{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00640","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 诚敬 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 诚敬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"顾惟菲质，忝位椒宫。\n虔奉苹藻，肃事神宗。\n敢申诚絜，庶罄深衷。\n睟容有裕，灵享无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00640.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00640","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}